 "lines": [
  "If your dog ever says, we need to talk, sit down. He's had seven years to prepare.",
  "What if your pet could talk?",
  "For starters, every command would turn into an argument.",
  "Off the couch.",
  "I was here first.",
  "I pay rent.",
  "And I'm the only one who answers the door. We all contribute.",
  "And imagine what he could tell you about your girlfriend. She still thinks he's just a dog.",
  "Remember the bloke she said was her cousin?",
  "Yeah?",
  "I really hope she lied about him being her cousin.",
  "Then he'd figure out he could blackmail you too.",
  "Give me the crust, or I'll tell her who actually ate her birthday cake.",
  "You ate her birthday cake.",
  "Yeah. Who held the plate?",
  "Good thing he can't talk."
